{:paths ["src" "test"]
 ;; The Tcl adapter's FFI seam is the host's (babashka.ffi on babashka and the
 ;; JVM via the :jvm alias's org.babashka/ffi, jolt.ffi on Jolt), so it is not
 ;; a module dep. The hikap library is an external pinned dependency at the
 ;; root. babashka.fs walks this module's files.
 :deps {babashka/fs {:mvn/version "0.5.34"}}}
